OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is happening with the
OL,4,ARosebank and Jackdaw oil and gas
OL,5,Afields?
OL,6,
OL,7,FA decision on whether to give the go
OL,8,Fahead to two oil and gas fields has
OL,9,Fedged a step closer.
OL,11,FAfter years of debates and legal
OL,12,Fwrangling, public consultations on
OL,13,Fupdated plans for the Rosebank oil
OL,14,Ffield off Shetland and the Jackdaw gas
OL,15,Ffield, which lies east of Aberdeen, are
OL,16,Fclosing.
OL,18,FIndustry bodies argue that starting
OL,19,Fproduction at the sites will provide
OL,20,Fjobs and improve the UK's energy
OL,21,Fsecurity as overseas conflicts threaten
OL,22,Fsupply.
